ox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Hello.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/06/Hello..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212034242\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Hello.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/06/Hello..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034242\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/06/Hello..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034242 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/06/Hello..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212034242 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Hello.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Hello..png\" data-image-name=\"Hello..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\">Iain Stirling</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_can_hear_it_gooping.\" title=\"I can hear it gooping.\">I can hear it gooping.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.\" title=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Hello.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 8 May 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\">Iain Stirling</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hello.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Hello\" was yelled into a baby monitor dozens of times by <a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\">Paul Sinha</a>, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_receiver_of_this_baby_monitor\" title=\"Find the receiver of this baby monitor\">Find the receiver of this baby monitor</a> task. The title card is a wide shot at <a href=\"/wiki/Buckinghamshire_Railway_Centre\" title=\"Buckinghamshire Railway Centre\">Buckinghamshire Railway Centre</a>, the location used for the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_as_close_as_you_can_to_Alex_without_him_noticing_you\" title=\"Get as close as you can to Alex without him noticing you\">Get as close as you can to Alex without him noticing you</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hello.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hallo', which translates as 'Hello'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Huhuu', which translates as 'Hello'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hello.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_powerful_smell\" title=\"Most powerful smell\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most powerful smell.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_receiver_of_this_baby_monitor\" title=\"Find the receiver of this baby monitor\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Find the receiver of this baby monitor. You must leave your hat on.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_ventriloquist_dummy_and_be_chatted_up_by_it\" title=\"Make the best ventriloquist dummy and be chatted up by it\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best ventriloquist dummy and be chatted up by it.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_as_close_as_you_can_to_Alex_without_him_noticing_you\" title=\"Get as close as you can to Alex without him noticing you\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Alex is on that bridge in the distance with lights on his head. Get as close as you can to Alex without him noticing you. Alex will duck down behind the wall for 10 seconds, then pop up for 10 seconds, then back down for 10 seconds, and so on until he notice you.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_greatest_weight_of_doughnuts_in_your_bucket\" title=\"Get the greatest weight of doughnuts in your bucket\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get the greatest weight of doughnuts in your bucket. You must have your hands on your hips at all times.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Peel_a_banana_using_only_your_feet\" title=\"Peel a banana using only your feet\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Peel a banana using only your feet. You cannot touch the banana with your hands. The peeled banana cannot be damaged.\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>20</b>\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hello.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_8,_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_%22Hello%22\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b4/Taskmaster_-_Series_8%2C_Episode_1_-_Full_Episode_-_%22Hello%22/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003945\" alt=\"Ta